UNSPSC
  Code references only (segment/family/class/commodity, eight digits), cited from a public-sector
  republication of the codeset (State of Oklahoma, Office of Management and Enterprise Services)
  recorded with its URL and SHA-256 in data/reference/manifest.json. UNSPSC(R) is published by
  GS1 US; no UNSPSC content is redistributed by this repository.

  UNSPSC defines no technical attribute layer -- verified by inspection of all 71,502 commodity
  rows on 2026-08-20. The ETIM <-> UNSPSC bridge
  (ecosystem/src/errata_ecosystem/data/etim-unspsc-bridge.yaml) is original work by The Errata
  Authors, published under Apache-2.0 with the ODC-By attribution above; its ETIM-derived
  attribute layer is computed at load time from the ETIM release, never copied into the file.

ECLASS
  NOT INCLUDED. ECLASS requires a licence, priced by company size. No ECLASS class, property,
