  in any published benchmark set. The /eclass-adapter component reads the customer's own licensed
  dictionary files at runtime. See docs/adr/ADR-003.

Manufacturer datasheets
  NOT REDISTRIBUTED. Datasheets referenced by the benchmark and test fixtures are copyrighted by
  their publishers. This repository stores URLs, SHA-256 content hashes, page-level annotation
  layers, bounding-box coordinates and gold values only. A fetch script reconstructs the corpus
  locally from the publishers' own servers.

ExtractBench
